=C3=B3 m=E1=BB=99t few critical insights:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=8C=B1 <strong>Performance=
 is Everything:</strong>
Geometry property access is not free. M=E1=BB=97i query c=C3=B3 th=E1=BB=83=
