ousands of elements, inefficient geometry usage can kill performance.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=94=AC <strong>Browser Dif=
ferences Matter:</strong>
Cross-browser consistency requires deep understanding c=E1=BB=A7a engine di=
fferences. Safari's overlay scrollbars, Firefox's sub-pixel rounding, Chrom=
e's aggressive optimization - these all affect real applications.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F <strong>Measu=
rement Strategy is Architecture:</strong>
How you approach element measurements affects entire application architectu=
re. Batched measurements, caching strategies, v=C3=A0 performance monitorin=
g are not afterthoughts - they're foundational decisions.</p>
